# Ali from Cairo judges the damage's life loss with its controller's other life results of the same damage event, and
# its controller orders it against a replacement on another of them (CR 120.4c, 616.1). Bot1, at 2 life, blocks one of
# Bot2's five attacking Memnites with Rhox Faithmender (lifelink; "If you would gain life, you gain twice that much life
# instead"). Combat damage is one event (CR 510.2): Bot1 loses 4 to the four unblocked Memnites and gains 1 by lifelink.
# Bot1 applies Ali's floor first: losing 4 and gaining 1 from 2 would leave -1, so the loss becomes 2, which with the
# gain of 1 leaves exactly 1. The Faithmender then doubles the gain to 2: Bot1 ends at 2 - 2 + 2 = 2. (Faithmender first
# would end at 1; a floor that ignored the gain would end at 3; no floor at 0.)

[Life]
Bot1: 2

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Ali from Cairo
Rhox Faithmender
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Memnite
Memnite
Memnite
Memnite
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus#1.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ali from Cairo.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Rhox Faithmender.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T4 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
Bot2.Attack(Memnite#1 > Bot1; Memnite#2 > Bot1; Memnite#3 > Bot1; Memnite#4 > Bot1; Memnite#5 > Bot1)
Bot1.Block(Rhox Faithmender > Memnite#1)
Bot1.Replace(1)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Ali from Cairo.Types = Creature
